    <string name="guide_title">Gestures and games</string>
    <string name="guide_gestures">Default gestures</string>
    <string name="guide_hint">Hold your hand about 40 cm in front of the camera. How well it works depends on light and surroundings.</string>
    <string name="guide_gesture_1">Open palm: light on</string>
    <string name="guide_gesture_1_text">Hold a fist in front of the camera for 1 to 2 seconds until the light breathes cyan, then open your hand quickly.</string>
    <string name="guide_gesture_2">Clench fist: light off</string>
    <string name="guide_gesture_2_text">Hold your open palm in front of the camera for 1 to 2 seconds until the light breathes cyan, then make a fist quickly.</string>
    <string name="guide_gesture_3">Pinch: brightness</string>
    <string name="guide_gesture_3_text">Spread thumb and index finger at least 45 degrees and hold for 1 to 2 seconds until the light blinks white. Spread wider for brighter, pinch for darker, without the fingers touching. Then take your hand away.</string>
    <string name="guide_gesture_4">OK: start or stop following</string>
    <string name="guide_gesture_4_text">Hold the OK sign for 1 to 2 seconds until the light blinks white. The head now follows your hand slowly. Show OK again to stop.</string>
    <string name="guide_games">Games</string>
    <string name="game_1">Naughty game</string>
    <string name="game_1_text">If the lamp looks left and right quickly and its colour keeps changing, it wants to tease. Point a thumbs up somewhere and it turns cheekily the other way.</string>
    <string name="game_2">Light mouse</string>
    <string name="game_2_text">If the lamp flickers in different positions, it wants to play. Switch it off with the fist gesture, it jumps to another spot and lights up again. Be as quick as you can.</string>
    <string name="game_3">Getting attention</string>
    <string name="game_3_text">If the lamp stares at your hand and blinks twice now and then, it feels ignored and wants to play.</string>
    <string name="game_4">Rock and roll</string>
    <string name="game_4_text">Hold the rock gesture for 1 to 2 seconds for a light show.</string>
    <string name="game_5">Power of love</string>
    <string name="game_5_text">Hold the I love you gesture for 1 to 2 seconds and the lamp dances.</string>
    <string name="game_6">Tap for night light</string>
    <string name="game_6_text">In the dark, tap the lamp gently to switch on the night light.</string>

