    <string name="about_notes">Notes</string>
    <string name="about_notes_text">Pipidy talks to your lamps only inside your home network and needs no account.\n\nA Pipi lamp accepts commands only after it has been added to Mi Home once. Its token can then be read with the Xiaomi Cloud Tokens Extractor. Yeelights only need LAN control switched on.\n\nPipidy is not affiliated with Xiaomi, Dreame or Yeelight.</string>
